#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:1
msgid "Portfolio, risk, optimization and simulation"
msgstr "投资组合、风险、优化与模拟"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide covers the four areas that share one failure model: they own "
"their inputs, they report what happened instead of returning a plausible-"
"looking number, and they state their preconditions in the header. The API "
"reference carries the exact fields; this page explains how to use them "
"together."
msgstr ""
"本指南覆盖共享同一套失败模型的四个领域：它们拥有自己的输入，报告发生了什么而不是返回看起来合理的数字，并在头文件里写明前置条件。API "
"参考给出确切字段；本页说明如何把它们配合使用。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:8
msgid "Portfolio inputs own their data"
msgstr "组合输入拥有自己的数据"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:10
msgid ""
"`portfolio_inputs` copies the frames it is given at ingestion, so a later "
"mutation of the caller's frame never reaches the report. `materialize()` "
"returns fresh frames on every call: mutating the result does not affect the "
"next call."
msgstr ""
"`portfolio_inputs` 在接收时就复制传入的帧，因此之后修改调用方的帧永远不会影响报表。`materialize()` "
"每次调用都返回新帧：修改结果不会影响下一次调用。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:14
msgid ""
"The four maps keys are fixed — `returns`, `positions`, `transactions` and "
"`benchmark_returns`. \"Not supplied\" and \"supplied but empty\" are "
"different states: the first materializes to no key at all, the second to one"
" key holding an empty frame."
msgstr ""
"四个映射键是固定的 —— `returns`、`positions`、`transactions` 与 "
"`benchmark_returns`。“未提供”和“提供了但为空”是两种状态：前者物化为没有键，后者物化为一个持有空帧的键。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:19
msgid ""
"Positions are row-oriented, not date-keyed: two rows may share a timestamp, "
"and the caller's row order is preserved. The cash column is named `cash` by "
"default, counts in the allocation denominator and is excluded from the per-"
"asset output columns and from the asset count."
msgstr ""
"持仓是面向行的，不是按日期键控的：两行可以共享同一个时间戳，调用方的行顺序被保留。现金列默认名为 "
"`cash`，计入配置分母，并从逐资产输出列与资产计数中排除。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:24
msgid "Positions, transactions and capacity"
msgstr "持仓、交易与容量"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "Area"
msgstr "领域"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "Behaviour worth knowing"
msgstr "值得了解的行为"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "Round trips"
msgstr "往返交易"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid ""
"FIFO against a signed price; one block may close and reopen within the same "
"direction"
msgstr "按带符号价格做 FIFO；同一方向下同一块可以平仓后重新开仓"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "Turnover"
msgstr "换手"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid ""
"Uses the per-date book; the first day of a book with no previous state is "
"halved"
msgstr "使用逐日账面；没有前一日状态的第一天按一半计算"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "Capacity"
msgstr "容量"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid ""
"Days to liquidate combine position size, rolling mean volume and the "
"tightest single-asset limit; ties resolve to the earliest date, then the "
"first asset"
msgstr "清仓天数综合持仓规模、滚动平均成交量与最紧的单资产限制；并列时先取最早日期，再取第一个资产"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "Transaction frames"
msgstr "交易帧"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid ""
"Daily notional adds absolute trade values, so a buy and a sell on the same "
"date reinforce rather than cancel; trading days count distinct dates"
msgstr "每日名义金额累加绝对交易值，因此同一天的买入与卖出相互叠加而不是抵消；交易日数统计的是不同日期"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:33
msgid ""
"These are accounting rules, not preferences: reports built from the same "
"transactions will match only if the same convention is used on both sides."
msgstr "这些是记账规则而不是偏好：只有两侧使用同一约定，同一批交易构建的报表才会一致。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:36
msgid "Risk estimates"
msgstr "风险估计"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:38
msgid ""
"`forecast_var` and `forecast_es` return a `risk_estimate` whose `estimate` "
"is **negative for losses** under the `losses_negative` sign convention. The "
"label is carried on the result, so a consumer never has to guess the sign."
msgstr ""
"`forecast_var` 与 `forecast_es` 返回 `risk_estimate`，在 `losses_negative` "
"符号约定下，其 `estimate` **对亏损为负**。符号约定随结果一起返回，消费方无需猜测。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:42
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"fincore::risk_forecast_config config;\n"
"config.method = fincore::risk_forecast_method::historical;\n"
"config.confidence_level = 0.99;\n"
"\n"
"const auto var = fincore::forecast_var(returns, config);\n"
"if (var.status == fincore::risk_estimate_status::ok) {\n"
"    std::printf(\"1-day 99%% VaR: %.4f\\n\", var.estimate);\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"fincore::risk_forecast_config config;\n"
"config.method = fincore::risk_forecast_method::historical;\n"
"config.confidence_level = 0.99;\n"
"\n"
"const auto var = fincore::forecast_var(returns, config);\n"
"if (var.status == fincore::risk_estimate_status::ok) {\n"
"    std::printf(\"1-day 99%% VaR: %.4f\\n\", var.estimate);\n"
"}\n"

