#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:87
#, python-format
msgid ""
"That is why zero exceptions at 99% on 250 days is `inconclusive` rather than"
" a pass: 2.5 expected exceptions is below the five-exception floor. "
"`basel_traffic_light` turns the exception count into `green`/`yellow`/`red` "
"using binomial bands that move with both the sample size and the confidence "
"level."
msgstr ""
"这就是 250 天 99% 下零例外是 `inconclusive` 而不是通过的原因：2.5 "
"个期望例外低于五个的门槛。`basel_traffic_light` 用随样本量与置信水平变动的二项分带，把例外数转成 "
"`green`/`yellow`/`red`。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:92
msgid "Walk-forward validation"
msgstr "滚动前推验证"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:94
msgid ""
"`walk_forward_var` re-fits on a rolling window and emits one forecast per "
"observation after the first complete window. The result reports `index`, "
"`forecast`, `realized`, `refit_timestamps`, `fits`, an optional `backtest`, "
"and a status:"
msgstr ""
"`walk_forward_var` 在滚动窗口上重新拟合，并在第一个完整窗口之后为每个观测产出一个预测。结果报告 "
"`index`、`forecast`、`realized`、`refit_timestamps`、`fits`、可选 `backtest` 与状态："

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "`ok`"
msgstr "`ok`"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "Forecasts were produced"
msgstr "产生了预测"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "`insufficient_data`"
msgstr "`insufficient_data`"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "The series is not longer than the window"
msgstr "序列长度不超过窗口"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "`unsupported`"
msgstr "`unsupported`"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid ""
"The requested target, horizon or quantile is not implemented; "
"`unsupported_reason` names it"
msgstr "请求的目标、期限或分位未实现；`unsupported_reason` 会说明"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:105
msgid ""
"The point-in-time invariant is testable: perturbing returns from some index "
"onward must leave every earlier forecast bit-identical, move the first "
"affected fit's mean and forecast by exactly the perturbation, and leave its "
"standard deviation unchanged. A constant shift moves the level, not the "
"dispersion."
msgstr "时点不变量是可检验的：从某个下标起扰动收益，必须让此前每个预测逐位不变，让第一个受影响的拟合均值与预测恰好移动该扰动量，并让其标准差保持不变。常数平移改变水平，不改变离散度。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:110
msgid "Optimization"
msgstr "优化"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "Entry point"
