msgstr "`optimize_portfolio`（`objectives.hpp`）"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid ""
"One of `max_sharpe`, `min_variance`, `target_return` or `target_risk`, with "
"box, sector and turnover constraints"
msgstr "`max_sharpe`、`min_variance`、`target_return` 或 `target_risk` 之一，支持箱式、行业与换手约束"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "`efficient_frontier` (`frontier.hpp`)"
msgstr "`efficient_frontier`（`frontier.hpp`）"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "Frontier points plus the minimum-variance and maximum-Sharpe portfolios"
msgstr "前沿点，以及最小方差与最大夏普组合"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid "`risk_parity` (`risk_parity.hpp`)"
msgstr "`risk_parity`（`risk_parity.hpp`）"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md
msgid ""
"Weights whose risk-contribution shares match an equal or user-supplied "
"budget; fixed 252-period year, weights bounded to `[1e-6, 1]` while solving"
msgstr "风险贡献份额匹配等权或用户给定预算的权重；固定 252 期年，求解时权重限制在 `[1e-6, 1]`"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:118
msgid ""
"Constraints are applied by projection, and the result reports diagnostics "
"that mirror the solved constraint set rather than a convergence flag. One "
"documented limitation matters when reading results: **`min_variance` without"
" sector constraints is solved over the unit simplex**, so it returns a long-"
"only book regardless of `short_allowed` or a negative `min_weight`."
msgstr ""
"约束通过投影施加，结果报告的诊断镜像实际求解的约束集合，而不是一个收敛标志。读结果时有一条已记录的限制：**不带行业约束的 `min_variance`"
" 在单位单纯形上求解**，因此无论 `short_allowed` 或负 `min_weight` 如何设置，它都返回长仓组合。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:124
msgid "Simulation"
msgstr "模拟"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:126
msgid ""
"Simulation functions take an explicit seed wherever the result must be "
"reproducible. Two facts are worth keeping straight:"
msgstr "需要可复现的结果处，模拟函数都接受显式种子。有两点需要分清："

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:129
msgid ""
"A seed reproduces a stream inside this library; it does not promise the same"
" numbers as a Python or NumPy call unless the function documents that "
"mapping (the MT19937 stream does)."
msgstr "种子只在本库内复现同一条流；除非函数写明了映射（MT19937 流写明了），否则不承诺与 Python 或 NumPy 给出相同数值。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:132
msgid ""
"Antithetic variates mirror the **return path** — `+10%` becomes `-10%` — "
"rather than inverting the wealth level, so a mirrored path is `90`, not `100"
" / 1.1`."
msgstr ""
"对偶变量镜像的是**收益路径** —— `+10%` 变成 `-10%` —— 而不是反转财富水平，因此镜像路径是 `90`，而不是 `100 / "
"1.1`。"

